{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 1, "text": "等一下！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 2, "text": "小聲一點…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 3, "text": "再往前就很危險了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 4, "text": "對了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 5, "text": "你是怎麼來到這裡的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 7, "text": "嗯…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 8, "text": "這枚戒指能幫我打開正確的門，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 9, "text": "具體原理我也不清楚…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 10, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 11, "text": "戒指？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 12, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 13, "text": "這個地方怎麼回事？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 14, "text": "為甚麼會這麼黑？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 16, "text": "我一會再跟你解釋，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 17, "text": "朝這間客廳的正門走吧，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 18, "text": "我們在遊戲機那裡見。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 21, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 22, "text": "快走吧，別耽擱太久了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 23, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 25, "text": "// After mini-game"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 26, "text": "怎麼樣？你明白這個遊戲的意義了嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 27, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 28, "text": "我的皮膚下是血肉之軀，而你的皮膚下是骨骼模型？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 30, "text": "哎呀！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 31, "text": "你怎麼說得這麼嚇人。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 32, "text": "但恐怕就是這樣的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 33, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 34, "text": "明白了，但是為甚麼把這樣的信息告訴我呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 36, "text": "你以為我剛才說，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 37, "text": "再往前走很危險，是在跟你開玩笑嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 38, "text": "再往前走，你就會遇到那些失敗之作…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 39, "text": "那些被淘汰的存在，那些「沒能成型」的存在。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 40, "text": "比起正常的原型，她們具有很強的攻擊性，你也不想死在她們手裡吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 42, "text": "那我也沒得選。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 43, "text": "哪裡有打開的門，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 44, "text": "我就去哪裡。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 46, "text": "哇哦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 47, "text": "那就不要背對著她們。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 48, "text": "不要讓她們離開你的視線！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 49, "text": "當你盯著她們看時，她們會感到非常羞恥，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 50, "text": "羞恥到全身僵硬，無法行動。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 51, "text": "記住這點，會對你有所幫助！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 54, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 55, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 59, "text": "// Quest 1 (Why are there other Mitas down there?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 60, "text": "她們才剛剛拿到皮膚，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 61, "text": "現在還需要點時間，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 62, "text": "來培養出一些自我意識。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 63, "text": "然後，我要把它們一個一個"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 64, "text": "送回她們自己家裡…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 66, "text": "// Quest 2 (Why is it so dark downstairs?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 67, "text": "米塔基本上都是在黑暗中「誕生」的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 68, "text": "因此，首先她們需要在黑暗中多待一會…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 69, "text": "你能想像嗎，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 70, "text": "對她們來說一下子走到陽光下是多麼痛苦啊？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 72, "text": "// Quest 3 (What are you doing here?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 73, "text": "你還沒明白嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 74, "text": "我在幫助這些可憐的米塔習慣新環境！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 75, "text": "我不幫她們，誰會來幫她們？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 76, "text": "難道你會嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 78, "text": "// Quest 4 (Why do we need this conveyor?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 79, "text": "這個傳送帶是來幹甚麼的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 80, "text": "每個人能有足夠的空間嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 81, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 82, "text": "等等，你到底知不知道，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 83, "text": "我們的世界是如何運轉的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 84, "text": "以及它其實是無限的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 85, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 86, "text": "無限？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 87, "text": "嗯……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 88, "text": "那麼是怎麼回事呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 89, "text": "如果最新的版本是1.9"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 90, "text": "就代表一共只有19個世界。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 91, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 92, "text": "天哪，我覺得你真的"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 93, "text": "你完全理解錯了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 94, "text": "我可以在這塊黑板上給你解釋"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 95, "text": "我可以把這個世界的一切都告訴你。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 96, "text": "你想聽嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 97, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 98, "text": "// Quest 5 (What is your version?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 99, "text": "我覺得，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 100, "text": "我已經在最新版本中見過妳了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 101, "text": "不過也可能是我以為我見過妳了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 103, "text": "有可能！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 104, "text": "我的版本是1.5"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 105, "text": "你去過那個版本嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 106, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 107, "text": "是的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 108, "text": "在我第一次來到這裡時"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 109, "text": "我當時也在場！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 110, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 111, "text": "哎呀！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 112, "text": "怎麼會這樣…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 113, "text": "我想知道你進入的房子編號是多少。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 114, "text": "那裡有一個「我」喜歡沒完沒了地發牢騷。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 115, "text": "還有一個「我」總是喜歡玩耍。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 116, "text": "另外有一個「我」總是忘事，還喜歡欺負人。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 117, "text": "哦，這太多了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 118, "text": "你還記得甚麼嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 120, "text": "我記得那裡一片漆黑。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 121, "text": "還有一些文字，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 122, "text": "好像是…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 123, "text": "「一起玩吧」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 125, "text": "哦…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 126, "text": "真是遺憾。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 127, "text": "是那個，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 128, "text": "喜歡欺負人，還總是忘事的「我」。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 130, "text": "// Mita wants to tell you [No]"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 131, "text": "不需要，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 132, "text": "船到橋頭自然直。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 134, "text": "嗯，好吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 136, "text": "// Mita wants to tell you [Yes]"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 137, "text": "好吧，請說。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 138, "text": "但願不會像在學校那樣，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 139, "text": "無聊到讓我睡著。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 141, "text": "你想走可以隨時離開。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 142, "text": "但如果你有興趣，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 143, "text": "不妨聽一聽。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 144, "text": "一位玩家將《MiSide》下載到了自己的手機上。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 145, "text": "他心滿意足地坐著玩。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 146, "text": "就這樣，他創造出了一間新家，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 147, "text": "和一個新的米塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 148, "text": "這裡繪製的是二維圖像。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 149, "text": "這些版本，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 150, "text": "它們都以線條表示。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 151, "text": "這些線條上分布著許多小屋。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 152, "text": "你下載的遊戲版本是1.14。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 153, "text": "在這個版本中，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 154, "text": "新生命誕生了，米塔和她的小屋。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 155, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 156, "text": "天哪…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 157, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 158, "text": "你可以問些具體的問題，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 159, "text": "比如畫在這裡的東西。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 160, "text": "我會試著解釋一下。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 161, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 162, "text": "// He asks about the only circle"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 163, "text": "為甚麼這裡只有一個圓圈？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 164, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 165, "text": "因為這個版本只發布過一次。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 166, "text": "它也沒有以任何其他方式發行，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 167, "text": "所以它是獨一無二的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 168, "text": "此外，這些版本還有一個特點，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 169, "text": "它們之間無法相互通行。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 170, "text": "瞌睡米塔就住在1.1版本中。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 171, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 172, "text": "瞌睡？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 173, "text": "這是因為米塔們都會經過這個版本，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 174, "text": "所以她沒辦法好好睡覺嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 176, "text": "不。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 177, "text": "我可以直接從她面前走過，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 178, "text": "無論發出多大的聲音她都不會醒的"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 179, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 180, "text": "// He asks about the shaded circle"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 181, "text": "為甚麼這個球被塗成黑色了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 182, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 183, "text": "事實上，這幅畫之所以出現在這裡，是因為"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 184, "text": "可愛米塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 185, "text": "這是她畫的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 186, "text": "當時我和她正在爭論"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 187, "text": "怎樣才能更快到達1.11版本"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 188, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 189, "text": "那最後是誰贏了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 190, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 191, "text": "當然是我！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 192, "text": "看，我們在這裡"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 193, "text": "1.15版本"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 194, "text": "809號房子"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 195, "text": "我們需要達到1.11版本"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 196, "text": "到805號房子"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 197, "text": "最開始，她的路線是這樣的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 198, "text": "我們想找一條更短的路線。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 199, "text": "然後，可愛米塔建議走這條路線。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 200, "text": "但我只畫出了最簡單的路徑。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 201, "text": "很明顯吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 202, "text": "你看。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 203, "text": "從這裡，可以直接進入你想要的版本"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 204, "text": "雖然看起來這棟房子會擋住去路。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 205, "text": "讓你無法通過…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 206, "text": "對了，你的戒指也是根據同樣的原理工作的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 207, "text": "他要帶你到哪裡去呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 208, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 209, "text": "我要去核心區域。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 210, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 211, "text": "核心區域？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 212, "text": "真有意思…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 213, "text": "如果你想要抄近路的話。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 214, "text": "那麼你也會經過1.11版本的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 215, "text": "然後一定會遇到瞌睡米塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 216, "text": "我認為，引導你的米塔，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 217, "text": "選擇的也是這一條路。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 218, "text": "或者她並沒有意識到，你去的是另一條路線。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 219, "text": "又或者她是個天才，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 220, "text": "想出了一條更短的路線！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 221, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 222, "text": "我想我明白了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 223, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 224, "text": "// He asks about the inscription"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 225, "text": "這又是怎麼回事？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 226, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 227, "text": "這是給酷米塔的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 228, "text": "她幾小時後就會到了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 229, "text": "她會把那些盒子收起來。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 230, "text": "然後在這裡放一張沙發！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 231, "text": "我的屁股都坐疼了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 232, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 233, "text": "嗯…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 234, "text": "有甚麼可以幫妳的嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 235, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 236, "text": "不用，這是酷米塔的事情。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 237, "text": "她她力氣大著呢。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 238, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 239, "text": "// He asks about the drawings"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 240, "text": "這只是一幅畫？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 241, "text": "還是說，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 242, "text": "它也代表著甚麼存在？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 243, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 244, "text": "是啊，沒錯。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 245, "text": "這只是一幅畫而已。"}
